==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Litleo|22}} from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion; both cards have the Live Coal attack.
*'''Live Coal''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Mysterious Treasures|Cyndaquil|79}} from the {{TCG|Mysterious Treasures}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

